---
import { loadBuildInfo } from '../lib/data';
const build = loadBuildInfo<{ dataAsOf: string; datasetVersion: string; dataMode: string }>();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <div>
        <p class="file-label">The public file remains open</p>
        <h2>Tools for the dark. Evidence for the record.</h2>
        <p>
          Built in public, versioned in git, and held to one standard across every party.
          Where a record ends, the gap is marked.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-system" aria-label="Current site status">
        <div><span>dataset</span><strong>{build.datasetVersion}</strong></div>
        <div><span>updated</span><strong>{build.dataAsOf}</strong></div>
        <div><span>mode</span><strong>{build.dataMode}</strong></div>
        <div><span>tracking</span><strong>none</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="foot-grid">
      <div>
        <h4>Open the file</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/toolkit/">The kit</a></li>
          <li><a href="/politicians/">The record</a></li>
          <li><a href="/signals/">The signals</a></li>
          <li><a href="/frontier/">The workbench</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Check the work</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/methodology/">Methodology</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sources/">Source registry</a></li>
          <li><a href="/coverage/">Coverage &amp; gaps</a></li>
          <li><a href="/corrections/">Corrections</a></li>
          <li><a href="/right-of-reply/">Right of reply</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Keep it moving</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/contribute/">Contribute</a></li>
          <li><a href="/mirrors/">Mirrors &amp; downloads</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about/">About the Collective</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/iamthevengence-orsomething/india-tech-collective" rel="noopener">GitHub</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="foot-disclaimer">
      A declared case is an accusation, not a conviction. Guilt is for courts alone.
      Dataset {build.datasetVersion} · updated {build.dataAsOf}
      {build.dataMode === 'demo' ? ' · DEMO DATA — not real records' : ''} · no trackers.
    </p>
    <p class="foot-signoff">Kept in public. <span lang="hi">सत्यमेव जयते।</span></p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .foot-signoff {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.67rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--file-khaki);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>
